title: Playground
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

Live examples of the `<<table>>` macro rendering a static table from a CSV block.

!! Basic table, sortable columns

@@.tblcsv-block
Title,Status,Priority
Buy milk,open,high
Call Alice,done,normal
Write report,open,low
@@

<<table>>

!! Custom delimiter, no header, right-aligned via class

@@.tblcsv-block.no-header
Alice|Paris|32
Bob|Lyon|28
@@

<<table tiddler:"Playground" id:"no-header" delimiter:"|" header:"no" class:"table-borderless">>

!! Column formats: date, email, rate, checkbox

@@.tblcsv-block.formats
Task,Due,Contact,Rating,Done
Ship release,20260930,team@example.com,***,x
Write docs,20261015,team@example.com,**,-
@@

<<table tiddler:"Playground" id:"formats" format:"text date email rate checkbox">>
